        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ab93ffe0-51c0-452d-af05-460c3de23877",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Manifest: The red\ncart carried\nbells. The blue\ncart carried",
                "blankets. The\nyellow cart\ncarried a pressure\nvalve to\nBrassworks.",
                "Silver S signed\nfor the yellow\ncart, then crossed\nout the",
                "destination. The\ncarbon copy\nsurvived."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dbb1909b-c649-4cff-ae61-188ea657f974",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ef525e85-c870-4a29-af18-672901ea7a31",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The valve account\nshows twenty Coins\nfor inspection,\nalready paid by",
                "Slush, and six for\nstorage, still\ndisputed. The city\nclaim slip",
                "keeps ownership\npublic. The\nforeman remembers\nSlush paying\npromptly",
                "when the pipe was\nmoved; he also\nremembers nobody\nagreeing to",
                "private ownership.\nPip suggests\nthanking him for\nthe actual payment",
                "without accepting\nthe extra claim.\nThe foreman hands\nyou a clean",
                "tally card."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3641b76-8329-4655-a222-922c6e40c8e7",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "26378495-c8a6-4991-ae7e-b40d07d7c2d5",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Inside the toolbox\nis the carbon\ncopy, folded\naround a biscuit.\nThe",
                "valve was not\nsold. It was sent\nfor inspection,\nwith the city",
                "retaining\nownership. Pip\nputs the biscuit\nback. Evidence\nshould have",
                "standards."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1bb43b94-3b87-4965-a6c4-d1e1c35fa84c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "273d7aed-f77b-4cd2-a511-1f8855c90876",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The gate register\nneeds the color of\nthe cart that\ncarried the",
                "valve. Which exit\nslip should the\nclerk retrieve?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "54cef2e4-e8d8-463a-a581-3359c3d4a571",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d0764002-8e12-415a-a571-cd66f397d11c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The tally must\nseparate a\nverified past\npayment from a\ndisputed",
                "charge. Which\namount can you\ntruthfully record\nas already paid by",
                "Slush? This is not\npermission to take\nmoney from your\nwallet. It is",
                "the figure the\nforeman will\nacknowledge, and\nSlush will see\nwhether",
                "you counted his\ncontribution\nhonestly."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "30fe192e-b7a6-4f16-a4fd-cf9a2d304cf5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0888afd4-2539-43d6-afc8-1408cd7c6e52",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Foreman: Sterling\nSlush paid the\ninspection bill.\nHe may own the",
                "bill, but that is\nnot the same as\nowning the valve.\nTell the archive",
                "clerk we still\nknow the\ndifference. Tell\nPip the kettle\ndoes not."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
